*** REDACTED BY owner-w61 ROUND 34, and the reason is stated rather than hidden ***
This file was produced by w61_r33_recontrol.py, whose CZ diagnostic printer echoes the
REAL INSTANCE a gate is blind to.  For the L1/G4-email probes that real instance IS the
assembled private local-part, so 2 occurrences of it were written into this artifact.
They are replaced above.  The standing constraint is absolute -- the private local-part
may not appear in ANY artifact -- and the r33 script violated it while testing the very
gate that exists to prevent it.  w61_r34_gates.py replaces that printer with a redacting
one.  SEPARATELY AND NOT REDACTED: this file also prints held-out A-row key values, for
the same reason.  That is repo-internal and acceptable on the same footing as SS7.48 --
but like SS7.48, THIS FILE MUST NEVER BE PASTED INTO A BRIEF.
